{
  "id": "unique-event-023",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "unique-event-023:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": " #23 - The fate of the Rosens\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,564,594]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-023:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You bring the mirror to the the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,594,626]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-023:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "walnut tree and shatter it.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,626,654]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-023:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Immediately, the ghosts of the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,654,685]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-023:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Rosens materialize from  the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,685,714]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-023:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "shattered mirror. Seven ghosts of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,714,748]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-023:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "children emerge from the ground\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,748,780]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-023:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "and assault them. As the nine\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,780,810]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-023:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "figures engage each other in a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,810,841]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-023:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "ghostly melee, you feel the curse\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,841,875]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-023:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "being lifted from you, and you run\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,875,910]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-023:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "away. You turn your head one last\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,910,944]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-023:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "time as Seth Rosen screams: “You\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,944,977]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-023:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "do not understand what you have\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,977,1009]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-023:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "done! Snowy Samuel! Snowy\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,1009,1035]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-023:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Samuel will come and the witch\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,1035,1066]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-023:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "children will take your soul!”\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,1066,1097]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-023:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The cries fade in the distance as\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,1097,1131]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-023:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you return to your exploration.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,1131,1163]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-023:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Write the keyword SNOWY on your\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,1163,1195]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-023:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "play sheet.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,1195,1207]]"
    }
  ],
